(The ACS 2026 Crime Report records 5.8 million retail crime incidents in the United Kingdom. The industry spent) Tj
T* (£313 million on security. The average store now pays an 11p crime tax on every transaction just to fund that) Tj
T* (spend. And things got worse.) Tj
ET
