0. Tc
62.3622047244094517 714.3309448818897636 Td
(Economic sterilisation is the doctrine of removing the resale value from stolen goods before they leave the store.) Tj
T* (It does not attempt to prevent the theft. It makes the theft commercially pointless.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.353 0.275 0.157 rg
0. Tc
62.3622047244094517 669.5435433070865656 Td
(The logic is straightforward. An OCG calculates target value as a function of liquidation probability. If the goods) Tj
T* (on a shelf can be acquired and converted to cash with predictable reliability, that shelf is a business asset. If the) Tj
T* (goods are marked in a way that makes them forensically dangerous to own and commercially unsellable, the) Tj
T* (shelf stops being an asset. The store drops off the target list, not because it has better cameras, but because) Tj
T* (the economics no longer work.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.353 0.275 0.157 rg
0. Tc
62.3622047244094517 578.8348818897636647 Td
(This is the only deterrence framework that operates on the incentive rather than the act. Physical deterrents) Tj
T* (escalate the risk of the acquisition phase. Economic sterilisation removes the reason to acquire. The distinction) Tj
T* (matters most for organised crime groups, which conduct systematic risk assessments before committing to a) Tj
T* (target. Random opportunists may not run the same calculation, but they are not the category generating £313) Tj
T* (million in annual loss.) Tj
ET
