(The retail security industry has spent four decades trying to stop theft at the moment it happens. The ADN-1 and) Tj
T* (the Toxic Inventory Registry operate on a different principle: make the theft commercially worthless before the) Tj
T* (thief reaches the door.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.353 0.275 0.157 rg
0. Tc
62.3622047244094517 654.2364566929134071 Td
(Economic sterilisation is not a security feature. It is a change to the underlying economics of whether a store is) Tj
T* (worth hitting. When an OCG calculates a target, the calculation ends at liquidation probability. Push that) Tj
T* (probability toward zero and the store drops off the list.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.353 0.275 0.157 rg
0. Tc
62.3622047244094517 594.1419685039369369 Td
(The Manchester Alpha Pilot is testing whether that theory holds in a real store, in a real street, against real) Tj
T* (organised crime. The data will be published. If the deterrence effect is measurable, the doctrine scales. If it is) Tj
T* (not, the data will say so and the doctrine will adapt.) Tj
